{"3985290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Samara", "steam_appid": 3985290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Samara</strong> is a semi–open world <strong>psychological horror game</strong> inspired by <strong>Thai beliefs and folklore</strong>, blending elements of mystery and dark fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a high school student who, along with your classmates, has been <strong>assigned to serve a punishment trip</strong> to clean up an abandoned rural school for three days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as night falls, strange things begin to happen.<br>Each night, <strong>one of your friends disappears</strong> without a trace. While searching for them, you are suddenly attacked—and killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, instead of dying…<br>you <strong>wake up again on the first day.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught in an endless <strong>time loop</strong>, you must uncover the truth, <strong>and find the murderer</strong>.<br>Every decision you make—every conversation, every discovery—can lead to a different path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you save your friends and escape together?<br>Or will your choices lead to <strong>a different ending</strong> altogether?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌙 <strong>Semi–open world exploration</strong> — freely investigate the school and its surroundings at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Time loop system</strong> — relive the same three days with new knowledge each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Multiple endings</strong> — your actions shape the story’s outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 <strong>Meaningful choices</strong> — dialogue and decisions affect relationships and future events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔒 <strong>Secrets to 